          ],
          "text": "A 9-year-old female was admitted with a 2-week history of polyuria, polydipsia, and 3 kg weight loss, followed by 2 days of vomiting, abdominal pain, and drowsiness, with a new diagnosis of diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA) in the context of new-onset type 1 diabetes mellitus.",
